{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01946","headline":"杂曲歌辞 辽东行 · 王建","name":"杂曲歌辞 辽东行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辽东万里辽水曲，古戍无城复无屋。\n黄云盖地雪作山，不惜黄金买衣服。\n战回各自收弓箭，正西回面家乡远。\n年年郡县送征人，将与辽东作丘坂。\n宁爲草木乡中生，有身不向辽东行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}